00:00:17.516 --> 00:00:18.516
Like, a lot.

00:00:19.326 --> 00:00:21.601
- I would consider the principal threats

00:00:21.601 --> 00:00:23.351
to start with Russia.

00:00:23.576 --> 00:00:26.226
