presidential election.

00:00:30.981 --> 00:00:31.814
- Russia.
- Russia.

00:00:31.814 --> 00:00:32.743
- Russia.
- Russia.

00:00:32.743 --> 00:00:33.576
- Russia.

00:00:33.576 --> 00:00:36.104
- And in the midst of
all these firestorms,

00:00:36.104 --> 00:00:40.753
I'm here while Russia is
hosting the 2018 FIFA World Cup.

00:00:40.753 --> 00:00:43.389
Which, for now, is giving
their people a chance

00:00:43.389 --> 00:00:45.662
